[{:db/id "q-127499/selection/de590ff4bd85e9688861472d848edf31b96af8abd7eda504fdbb5945a1fb2545" :answer/id #uuid "6b029d17-737c-570e-bcdd-c02a1295a428" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(x+1)(y+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127499/selection/f2b8a3ea33bf3fc611a6226c3b85a3a0745d8b7018b35cc1f3c5064dd7fdba71" :answer/id #uuid "6ce1ddc8-bd80-565b-afac-6b778dff1842" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)(1-y)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127499/selection/154d10b2aa1dbe44d03f02fdcb35511f30eb2b26f3a236b176bdb9626c343415" :answer/id #uuid "ffbfdf84-89ac-501d-9d0e-a8247119c053" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2(x+1)}{y-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127499/selection/9f2205f97bcf1eebb8dbaa947940ec457879bd02979caa1c9bfef1c05997b423" :answer/id #uuid "c950d74c-c1ed-5acd-b68d-2fc1b6c46651" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1-x}{y+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127499/selection/a4f90eed6cd3d5b5ccf6ccf0776e35c4d5860f4914411b3b72a1542aee9ecc01" :answer/id #uuid "90dd0c2b-eda3-55eb-83ec-8fdf22adb1cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x+1}{1-y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127499/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "86d9054f-01f4-5cdb-a841-f3ee6daaf735" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127499/selection/a4f90eed6cd3d5b5ccf6ccf0776e35c4d5860f4914411b3b72a1542aee9ecc01" :answer-field/choices ["q-127499/selection/de590ff4bd85e9688861472d848edf31b96af8abd7eda504fdbb5945a1fb2545" "q-127499/selection/f2b8a3ea33bf3fc611a6226c3b85a3a0745d8b7018b35cc1f3c5064dd7fdba71" "q-127499/selection/154d10b2aa1dbe44d03f02fdcb35511f30eb2b26f3a236b176bdb9626c343415" "q-127499/selection/9f2205f97bcf1eebb8dbaa947940ec457879bd02979caa1c9bfef1c05997b423" "q-127499/selection/a4f90eed6cd3d5b5ccf6ccf0776e35c4d5860f4914411b3b72a1542aee9ecc01"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127499" :question/id #uuid "8addafb3-53aa-51de-9e83-4de2a2f51ef5" :question/math-academy-id "q-127499" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062909/assets/2f08e0a0d1fd855f2d179ac65dbdf5d022f3488b85c78b5cbb507f12bd69487e.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the circle shown above." :question/worked-solution "Since our circle is centered at $(-1,1)$ and has a radius of $1,$ its equation is given by\n\n$$\n(x-(-1))^{2}+(y-1)^{2}={1}^{2}\\,⟹\\,(x+1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}=1.\n$$\n\nNow, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x+1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x+1)^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((y-1)^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2(x+1)+2(y-1)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2(y-1)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-2(x+1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{x+1}{y-1} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{x+1}{1-y}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127499/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1331279e-1a5f-5f6f-9104-0c88e1f9f6d0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127499"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500/selection/7064e6c39c1330031b928ece67dc302ebf183b90410ca8f09ff2ad9f68bc4c9c" :answer/id #uuid "b34aea3d-09f0-5e22-b539-71b51116cd7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2(x-3)}{y-2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500/selection/47bdf375dfe44eb49003fcb4def17394300c1f14f19d625534c7a1096c80f821" :answer/id #uuid "ff8ea6f6-2e4d-571e-bf91-2d7769a063d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y+2}{x-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500/selection/cd4a12490cc6322b6fa79c7105f9a2da607aa363a5573cfae98945d4bc1b8fc4" :answer/id #uuid "3b41ad3c-2218-5978-9b6c-81d5188c6da5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x+3}{y+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500/selection/391d9107fe04996967b8be28e7307c59c7827731529c2c72dcd596c79cd904de" :answer/id #uuid "6c655c1c-963b-55a7-b7bf-dec798042a61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2(y+2)}{x+3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500/selection/e3588c8cbfe5a96a6f7e1aaa46f580e38235f94aef833277c210c910cfe77a09" :answer/id #uuid "f76c4155-0a9e-5f83-a0b6-63f2b205a1e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y+2}{x+3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3c789b73-49a2-5de2-96d3-a48b39bfd1e2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127500/selection/cd4a12490cc6322b6fa79c7105f9a2da607aa363a5573cfae98945d4bc1b8fc4" :answer-field/choices ["q-127500/selection/7064e6c39c1330031b928ece67dc302ebf183b90410ca8f09ff2ad9f68bc4c9c" "q-127500/selection/47bdf375dfe44eb49003fcb4def17394300c1f14f19d625534c7a1096c80f821" "q-127500/selection/cd4a12490cc6322b6fa79c7105f9a2da607aa363a5573cfae98945d4bc1b8fc4" "q-127500/selection/391d9107fe04996967b8be28e7307c59c7827731529c2c72dcd596c79cd904de" "q-127500/selection/e3588c8cbfe5a96a6f7e1aaa46f580e38235f94aef833277c210c910cfe77a09"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127500" :question/id #uuid "9e4ebd8d-39de-546f-8e4d-90d9fb45b65a" :question/math-academy-id "q-127500" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062909/assets/78ad1a6835bb71441f77a3ca2bbdc93a42635e0386cda35fbe5fc9b0c9f48677.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the circle shown above." :question/worked-solution "Since our circle is centered at $(-3,-2)$ and has a radius of $2,$ its equation is given by\n\n$$\n(x-(-3))^{2}+(y-(-2))^{2}={2}^{2}\\,⟹\\,(x+3)^{2}+(y+2)^{2}=4.\n$$\n\nNow, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x+3)^{2}+(y+2)^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x+3)^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((y+2)^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2(x+3)+2(y+2)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2(y+2)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-2(x+3) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{x+3}{y+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127500/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1331279e-1a5f-5f6f-9104-0c88e1f9f6d0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127500"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502/selection/24640309f7c6b786a0e854eb6b5bf178e4a7d0e686f8d492ed9575665918b519" :answer/id #uuid "0fe66a0a-b5f6-53f9-9d7d-f33f4f488aa8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x-3}{y+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502/selection/6e2aecaa4e0c5868e85a5e99583842ec0270787756d7be2432737210577ec953" :answer/id #uuid "468a1494-fc5b-56b4-8316-13c1b67b633a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x+2}{3y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502/selection/48876a348be676d5cd393a2d15327a5b6bb85bee87dfd881f3f34b9616aeac30" :answer/id #uuid "d5031e23-dc2a-5f7b-8b9b-c55cb0125296" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y}{x+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502/selection/59d6a0b6356af9938786360f8302b41aa66fe91fdff612ca1a33d1375f60ac39" :answer/id #uuid "c32e4cd8-b012-591c-ba56-2197b57f0567" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{y+2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502/selection/1a64b04e1f5985e2b489075a43404a8905e5b019f2165aa04b06d92b4d313e16" :answer/id #uuid "b0ef93cb-7366-593e-ad38-c818c0850449" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{y+2}{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e144559b-9b8c-55c6-b20f-b375f68afb7d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127502/selection/59d6a0b6356af9938786360f8302b41aa66fe91fdff612ca1a33d1375f60ac39" :answer-field/choices ["q-127502/selection/24640309f7c6b786a0e854eb6b5bf178e4a7d0e686f8d492ed9575665918b519" "q-127502/selection/6e2aecaa4e0c5868e85a5e99583842ec0270787756d7be2432737210577ec953" "q-127502/selection/48876a348be676d5cd393a2d15327a5b6bb85bee87dfd881f3f34b9616aeac30" "q-127502/selection/59d6a0b6356af9938786360f8302b41aa66fe91fdff612ca1a33d1375f60ac39" "q-127502/selection/1a64b04e1f5985e2b489075a43404a8905e5b019f2165aa04b06d92b4d313e16"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127502" :question/id #uuid "40004000-9c6b-5eec-bba4-63cd6ff30027" :question/math-academy-id "q-127502" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062909/assets/812f88e913650b7924fc13acc7adde999819d0011fa547a7e0ad73cb37e3939f.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the circle shown above." :question/worked-solution "Since our circle is centered at $(0,-2)$ and has a radius of $3,$ its equation is given by\n\n$$\n(x-0)^{2}+(y-(-2))^{2}={3}^{2}\\,⟹\\,{x}^{2}+(y+2)^{2}=9.\n$$\n\nNow, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+(y+2)^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((y+2)^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2x+2(y+2)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2(y+2)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-2x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{x}{y+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127502/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1331279e-1a5f-5f6f-9104-0c88e1f9f6d0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127502"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127493/selection/775de478b72bda62